@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
skinparam shadowing false
title Consequential Command Guards and Recorded Outcome
start
:Establish validated actor, resource and operation context;
if (Required current authority established and permitted?) then (yes)
else (no)
 :Return safe denied / unavailable outcome;
 stop
endif
:Resolve stable request identity when required;
if (Existing identity?) then (yes)
 if (Same actor / operation / payload?) then (yes)
  :Resolve recorded outcome under current authority;
 else (no)
  :Return inconsistent request conflict;
 endif
 stop
endif
:Check exact version, selection and lifecycle under owning protocol;
if (Preconditions consistent?) then (yes)
 :Protect required artifact references / reservations;
 :Commit owning local state and applicable durable intent;
 :Finalize or reconcile external effects under owner contract;
 :Report actual confirmed / pending / unknown result;
else (no)
 :Return invalid / stale / unavailable result without unsafe mutation;
endif
stop
@enduml
